OL,3,ANew York Times executive fatally shot
OL,4,Aallegedly by elderly in-laws
OL,5,
OL,6,FA New York Times executive was fatally
OL,7,Fshot in California, allegedly by his
OL,8,Fwife's elderly parents who have been
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of murder.
OL,11,FJonathan McKinsey, 40, the newspaper's
OL,12,Fdirector of engineering for games
OL,13,Fplayer experience, was found with
OL,14,Fmultiple gunshot wounds in a car park
OL,15,Fin Dublin - 35 miles (56km) east of San
OL,16,FFrancisco - on Saturday afternoon,
OL,17,Fpolice said.
OL,19,FShouyong Zhang and Shili Chen, his
OL,20,Fparents-in-law who are both 77 years
OL,21,Fold, are facing multiple charges,
OL,22,Fincluding first-degree murder.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
